    "updated_at": "2026-11-12T18:49:16Z",
    "body": "Merged the parent and main to resolve conflicts. The new head is 2dc69835.\n\n- **Parent:** confirmed #1139 (`issue/533-wire-iso-post`) as this PR's parent. Its old head b9ddec58 is this branch's base, and none of #1144's commits are on this branch. I merged #1139's refreshed head 3dd4b820.\n  - One conflict, in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/structural.rs`. Both sides had added separate tests in the same place: this PR's `wire_machine_editor_structure`, and main's `setup_page_workholding_rpm_row_structure`, `ribbon_labels_whole_and_captions_painted` and the origin-names check. I kept both sides.\n- **upstream/main:** merged cleanly, with no further conflicts.\n- `git diff upstream/main --stat` lists only the chain's own files. No snapshot PNG, CHANGELOG, RECOMMENDED or PROCESS_VERSION changes.\n- **Gate:** `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed: post, motion, app and ui suites, 0 failed, 16.9 min. That run includes `wire_contour`, `wire_post`, `golden_cl` and the ui lib (structural). `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean.\n\nThe PR stays a draft. Ready for a re-check (/resolve-conflicts check).\n",
